- The ESP32-P4 drivers under kernel/src/platform/esp32p4v1.rs and
  kernel/src/platform/esp32p4v1/ were written in Rust by reading
  ESP-IDF 6.0's headers and sources: register addresses and fields,
  initialisation sequences and values (clock and PVT, PSRAM, I2C, entropy,
  SD, MIPI DSI, EMAC, PPA/DMA2D, cache and start-up). Each file names the
  ESP-IDF files it follows. No C code was copied.
- kernel/src/platform/esp32p4v1/psram.rs: TEST_DATA (the DQS tuning
  pattern) is copied from components/esp_hw_support/mspi_timing_by_dqs.c
  (s_test_data), SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2023-2024 Espressif Systems
  (Shanghai) CO LTD, SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0.

The second-stage bootloader that boot/ configures is built from ESP-IDF
and is not part of this repository.

